+The branch and remote task ref both point to
+`5f8bfbbd6e0c3a00dd0a3de0295e74f05990a0ec`. The accepted base
+`6fc2fd97dbdf40f5b0e46f846eaa0d78a1b33d12` remains an ancestor. The
+reviewed source hashes are:
